.venv/
trash/
misc/

# Terraform local state/cache (see infra/) - .terraform.lock.hcl IS committed.
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

# Environment-specific values (may include personal SSH keys, existing
# resource IDs) - never committed. *.tfvars.example IS committed as a
# template.
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!*.tfvars.example
